                    {
                      "type": "math",
                      "latex": "\\begin{aligned}d&=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2}\\\\d&=\\sqrt{(5-2)^2+(1-6)^2}\\\\d&=\\sqrt{34}\\\\d&\\approx5.83\\end{aligned}",
