                      "type": "math",
                      "latex": "\\begin{aligned}d&=\\sqrt{(6-(-3))^2+(-4-5)^2}\\\\d&=\\sqrt{9^2+(-9)^2}\\\\d&=\\sqrt{162}\\\\d&\\approx12.73\\end{aligned}",
